meta {
  name: Record Cash Payment With Change
  type: http
  seq: 18
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/restaurants/{{restaurant_id}}/orders/{{order_id}}/payments
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
      "method": "cash",
      "amount": 450,
      "tendered_amount": 500
  }
}

docs {
  A ৳450 bill paid with a ৳500 note. `amount` is what goes on the check (never
  more than the balance); `tendered_amount` is the cash handed over (cash only,
  must cover amount + tip_amount). The response's payment has
  `change_amount: 50`, and the shift's X/Z report counts it under
  `cash.cash_received` / `cash.change_given`.

  Needs an open register shift (Register Shifts → Open Shift). A card payment
  with `tendered_amount`, or cash received below amount + tip, returns 422 on
  errors.tendered_amount.
}
